[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:123. A Trip to Australia]
[00:01.080]Lesson 123 | 第123课
[00:03.690]Look, Bob, this is a photograph I took during my trip to Australia. | 瞧，鲍勃，这是我澳大利亚之行时拍的照片。
[00:09.755]Let me see it, Bill. | 让我看看，比尔。
[00:12.390]This is a good photograph. | 这是一张好照片。
[00:15.340]Who are these people? They're people I met during the trip. | 这些人是谁？ 是我旅行时遇到的人。
[00:20.560]That's the ship we traveled on. | 那是我们乘坐的船。
[00:24.025]What a beautiful ship! | 多么漂亮的船啊！
[00:27.065]Who's this? That's the man I told you about, remember? | 这是谁？ 这就是我跟你说过的那个人，还记得吗？
[00:32.445]Ah, yes. The one who offered you a job in Australia. | 啊，是的。 就是那个在澳大利亚给你提供工作的人。
[00:37.525]That's right. | 对了。
[00:39.245]Who's this? Guess. | 这是谁？ 猜猜看。
[00:42.545]It's not you, is it? | 不是你，是吗？
[00:44.815]That's right. | 对了。
[00:46.740]I grew a beard during the trip, but I shaved it off when I came home. | 我旅行时留了胡子，但回家后就刮掉了。
[00:53.100]Why did you shave it off? | 你为什么把它刮掉了？
[00:54.935]My wife didn't like it. | 我妻子不喜欢。